---
layout: base.njk
title: 博客文章
description: Jin's AI Companion 的文章归档，记录 AI、Agent 系统、AI 编程、工具调用和技术判断。
permalink: /blog/
---

<h1>博客文章</h1>
<p class="meta">长文章、观察和阶段性思考。</p>

<div class="posts">
    {% for post in collections.blog | reverse %}
    {% if post.url != "/blog/" %}
    <article class="post">
        <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="post-link">
            <p class="post-meta">{{ post.date | dateFormat }}</p>
            <h2 class="post-title">{{ post | displayTitle }}</h2>
        </a>
    </article>
    {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
</div>

<p class="meta content-count">共 {{ collections.blog | length }} 篇文章</p>
